sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DD as Datadog
  participant GW as HTTPS Gateway
  participant A as Authenticator
  participant V as Validator/Scrubber
  participant G as Mutation Gate
  participant R as Redis Idempotency
  participant O as Durable Outbox
  participant W as Mutation Worker
  participant J as Jira
  participant L as Audit Ledger

  DD->>GW: POST synthetic/allowlisted event + signature
  GW->>A: Forward exact body + auth headers
  A->>A: Verify HMAC over exact UTF-8 body
  A->>A: Check signature format, timestamp, replay window
  alt Invalid, stale, or missing signature
    A-->>GW: 401, request ID only
    A->>L: Append rejected-auth result (scrubbed)
    GW-->>DD: 401
  else Authenticated
    A->>V: Pass authenticated body
    V->>V: Validate schema and remove forbidden fields
    alt Invalid schema or scrubber failure
      V-->>GW: 422 or 500, no raw body
      V->>L: Append rejected-content or scrub-failure result
      GW-->>DD: 422/500
    else Valid and scrubbed
      V->>G: Ask whether mutation is enabled
      alt Gate paused or unknown control state
        G-->>GW: 503, retryable, no Jira call
        G->>L: Append fail-closed gate result
        GW-->>DD: 503
      else Gate open
        G->>R: Check completed key and acquire lock atomically
        alt Completed key exists
          R-->>G: Completed result + Jira issue reference
          G-->>GW: 200 duplicate/no-op
          G->>L: Append duplicate result
          GW-->>DD: 200
        else Lock acquired
          R-->>G: Lock owner token
          G->>O: Persist bounded accepted event/outbox state
          O->>W: Dispatch mutation work
          W->>J: Create/update bounded corrective action
          J-->>W: Success + issue key
          W->>L: Append mutation result
          W->>R: Store bounded completion record with replay-window TTL
          W->>R: Compare token and release lock
          W-->>GW: 200 accepted/completed
          GW-->>DD: 200
        else Lock unavailable and no completion
          R-->>G: Another worker owns lock
          G-->>GW: 503 or bounded duplicate-in-progress response
          G->>L: Append contention result
          GW-->>DD: 503
        end
      end
    end
  end

