sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DD as Datadog
  participant R as Redis
  participant W1 as Worker A
  participant W2 as Worker B
  participant J as Jira
  participant L as Audit Ledger

  DD->>W1: Event E (first delivery)
  W1->>R: SET lock(E) token-A NX EX 300
  R-->>W1: OK
  DD->>W2: Event E (duplicate delivery)
  W2->>R: GET completed(E)
  R-->>W2: empty
  W2->>R: SET lock(E) token-B NX EX 300
  R-->>W2: nil, lock owned by A
  W2->>L: Record duplicate-in-progress
  W2-->>DD: 503, safe to retry
  W1->>J: Single bounded mutation for E
  J-->>W1: HMSI-42 created
  W1->>L: Record mutation for E
  W1->>R: SET completed(E) bounded result EX replay-window
  W1->>R: Compare-and-delete lock(E), token-A
  W1-->>DD: 200
  DD->>W2: Retry E
  W2->>R: GET completed(E)
  R-->>W2: HMSI-42 / completed
  W2->>L: Record duplicate-after-completion
  W2-->>DD: 200, no second Jira call

