sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Mutation Worker
  participant J as Jira
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as Audit Ledger
  participant OP as On-call

  W->>J: Create/update bounded corrective action
  J--xW: Timeout after possible commit
  W->>L: Record unknown external outcome
  W->>R: Do not mark completed, retain reconciliation state
  W->>OP: Page with event fingerprint only
  OP->>J: Search by deterministic external alert key
  alt Jira issue exists
    J-->>OP: Existing issue key
    OP->>R: Store reconciled completion record
    OP->>L: Record reconciliation, no retry mutation
  else No Jira issue exists
    OP->>W: Authorize one bounded retry
    W->>J: Retry with same deterministic external key
    J-->>W: Success or bounded failure
    W->>R: Store completion only after audit policy is satisfied
    W->>L: Record final outcome
  end

---

flowchart TD
  START[Request arrives] --> AUTH{HMAC valid and fresh?}
  AUTH -- No --> R401[401, audit rejection, no body persistence]
  AUTH -- Yes --> SCHEMA{Allowlisted schema and scrubber pass?}
  SCHEMA -- No --> R422[422/500, audit rejection, no mutation]
  SCHEMA -- Yes --> GATE{Mutation gate OPEN?}
  GATE -- No/Unknown --> R503[503, fail closed, page owner]
  GATE -- Yes --> DONE{Completed idempotency record?}
  DONE -- Yes --> DUP[200 duplicate, no Jira call]
  DONE -- No --> LOCK{Atomic lock acquired?}
  LOCK -- No --> BUSY[503 or bounded retry, no Jira call]
  LOCK -- Yes --> OUTBOX[Durably accept bounded work]
  OUTBOX --> JIRA{Jira outcome known?}
  JIRA -- Success --> AUD[Audit mutation + completion record]
  JIRA -- Retryable failure --> RETRY[Bounded retry with backoff]
  JIRA -- Timeout/unknown --> RECON[Pause gate, reconcile by external key]
  RETRY --> JIRA
  RECON --> AUD
  AUD --> OK[Release lock conditionally, 200 only after safe acceptance]
